.TH VIBEOS-CONTACTS 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-contacts \- contacts app for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-contacts
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS Contacts app rebuilt in GTK 4 on evolution-data-server: the
contact list, a contact's details, the editor and the contact picker. It is
D-Bus activatable as vibeos.Contacts.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-dialer(1), vibeos-messaging(1)
